within Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.C_CardiovascularSystem.C08C_SelectiveCalciumChannelBlockersWithMainlyVascula.C08CA05_Nifedipine;
model Nifedipine_Kiriyama2024_PD_bp
  "indirect_response_i exposure-response sweep — Kiriyama_2024 :: BP (blood pressure)"
  extends Pharmacolibrary.Pharmacodynamic.IndirectTurnoverSweep(
    E0 = 96.8,      // [mmHg]
    Emax = 67.1,  // type IV effect term
    EC50 = 8.63e-05,  // [kg/m3; ng/mL × 1e-06]
    gamma = 1,
    exposure_per_s = 1e-06);   // 1 ng/mL per second
  // emax_not_a_fraction: type I needs Imax ≤ 1 but the record has 67.1; bound as the reciprocal stimulation form (IV) the paper fitted
  // defaulted: gamma
  annotation(experiment(StartTime = 0, StopTime = 130, Interval = 0.26),
    Documentation(info = "<html><body><h4>Nifedipine_Kiriyama2024_PD_bp</h4><p>The steady-state exposure-response curve of Kiriyama A et al., <i>Pharmacology research &amp; perspectives 12(4):e1249</i> 2024 (<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1002/prp2.1249\">doi:10.1002/prp2.1249</a>) — blood pressure [mmHg] against nifedipine ng/mL — obtained by sweeping the driver instead of simulating a dose. Model family: indirect_response_i.</p><h4>The parameters, in the paper's terms</h4><pre>  E0    =       96.8 mmHg     drug-free response (baseline) (E0, Q324)
  Emax  =       67.1          maximal effect term (Emax,1, Q323)
  EC50  =       86.3 ng/mL    exposure at half of the maximal effect term (EC50,1, Q321)
  gamma = (library default) Hill coefficient</pre><p>The algebra is <a href=\"modelica://Pharmacolibrary.Pharmacodynamic.IndirectTurnoverSweep\">IndirectTurnoverSweep</a>; this model only supplies the numbers. The x axis is one ng/mL of nifedipine per second of simulated time (exposure is in kg/m3): there is no state, no dose and no kinetics — plot <code>response</code> against <code>exposure</code> (or <code>time</code>).</p><p>The effect term enters as a reciprocal (steady state of <code>der(R) = Kin - Kout*(1 + Emax*frac)*R</code>), so EC50 is the exposure at half the maximal STIMULATION of turnover, not at half the response.</p><h4>What it reproduces</h4><pre>  exposure = 0         response 96.8   (drug-free)
  exposure = EC50 (86.3 ng/mL)  response 2.802
  exposure -> infinity  response 1.421</pre></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Kiriyama_2024: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: accepted with caveats</li></ul></body></html>"));
end Nifedipine_Kiriyama2024_PD_bp;
